  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "expr0 = R[dX[\\[Mu],0,z]];\nexpected0 = (z-z0) R[dX[\\[Mu],1,z0]];\ntest0 = Simplify[TaylorAtOrderHolo[expr0,1,z0] - expected0] === 0;\nPrint[\"Test 0 (dX holo order 1): \", If[test0, \"PASSED\", \"FAILED\"]];\ntest0",
